  "canonicalOwner": "Existing parseWeightGoal, createWeightGoalView, projectBodyComposition, calculateSummary and settings.save own validation, projection and persistence. targetPolicy.weightGoal projects a narrow settings patch; the authenticated preview endpoint and workspace command share that parser. No schema or domain arithmetic changed.",
  "behavior": [
    "Source overview, two-step goal/rate review, units/start details, help, fixed footer, active/inactive state and exact Current Weight selection.",
    "Forecast and default energy preview use canonical source owners. Scheduled daily targets stay separate and unchanged. Expenditure, macros, display, and unrelated settings are preserved.",
    "Current Weight opens the existing record editor with the exact canonical selection and unit. Missing selected measurement fails without substituting a different metric. Unknown body inputs stay unknown.",
    "Cancel/back abort pending previews. Invalid captures disable save. A stale revision requires reload. Ambiguous writes retry the same immutable workspace receipt.",
    "Macro & Energy source shares target routing and projections; see macro-energy-source.json."
  ],
